Theorem RL-22: KnownSafe pair elimination

  Preconditions:
    - KnownSafe pair elimination per Annex E §AIMS RL-22
    - Physical RC provably positive (outer RcInc in scope, no intervening dec)
    - Initial: KnownSafe := false at function entry
    - Transfer: RcInc(v) -> KnownSafe(v) := true; RcDec(v) -> false for v, SSA aliases, borrow aliases
    - Set/SetTag/may_deallocate calls -> false for all v

  Soundness property:
    Forall function f, variable v, program point p with inner RcInc(v) / RcDec(v) pair.
      KnownSafe(v) at p = true
        implies eliminate inner inc/dec pair on v at p.

  Proof obligation:
    sorry -- discharged by sec-08 realization rule proofs

    Engines dispatched:
      rc_counting
      refinement
      case_analysis

  Expected:
