Theorem RL-26: RC motion barrier restrictions

  Preconditions:
    - RC motion barrier restrictions per Annex E §AIMS RL-26
    - Barriers for v: (a) calls passing v to Owned or may_share=true param; (b) IsShared(v); (c) Set/SetTag on v or any aggregate containing v
    - RcDec(v) additionally cannot move past any use of v or aliases

  Soundness property:
    Forall function f, variable v, candidate motion move RC_op(v) from p_old to p_new.
      RC_op = RcInc(v): MUST NOT cross any barrier for v on path (p_old, p_new)
      RC_op = RcDec(v): MUST NOT cross any barrier for v AND MUST NOT cross any use of v or aliases.

  Proof obligation:
    sorry -- discharged by sec-08 realization rule proofs

    Engines dispatched:
      rc_counting
      refinement
      case_analysis

